{"availability":"available","full":"edison16a/standoff","name":"standoff","description":"Multiplayer game console for the web. Use your phones as controllers and have fun with interactive games!","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":7,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T03:52:02Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:22:42Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://standoffgames.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://standoffgames.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:45.610Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:45.610Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:45.610Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:18.488Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:36:38.365Z","stars":7,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:45.610Z","stars":7,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Standoff turns any computer into a games console, and every phone in the room into a controller.","I loved the Wii, the PS5 and the Xbox, but there were never enough controllers, and I can't bring my Xbox everywhere. Everyone already carries a phone full of motion sensors, and almost every laptop has a camera. Standoff puts them to work.","The home screen works like a console menu. Big tiles show each game, and the chosen one grows and gets a ring in its own colour. A clip of the game really being played fills the screen behind it, with a warm lobby tune and menu sounds. Arrow keys, clicks or taps move along the row, and it loops round like a carousel."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edison16a/standoff/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3f4b5c6748886f97fb44e413eb33880a3b47cd781126b1b60327c74cca4fdcd6","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:45.724Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:45.724Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Standoff turns any computer into a games console, and every phone in the room into a controller.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/edison16a/standoff/blob/main/README.md"},"au